      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَشَحٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain disease</i> (<i>which attacks a man,</i>
S, K,) <i>in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَشْح</span>, (meaning the <i>flank,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاصِرَة</span>,
